.TH GLIMPSE-MEDIA-VIEWER 1 "October 2026" "1.0.5" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
glimpse-media-viewer \- view and organise your images, videos and music
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B glimpse-media-viewer
.RI [ file-or-folder ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B glimpse-media-viewer
shows a picture, video or song, with every image, video and music file in its folder listed in
the sidebar. Given a folder, it opens its first file. Without one, it opens the folder it showed last.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/glimpse/settings.json
Settings and pinned folders.
.TP
.I ~/.cache/glimpse/tags.db
The search index of file names, dates and picture tags.
.SH SEE ALSO
Press F1 in the app for help, and Ctrl+? for keyboard shortcuts.
